%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs that... your father?\d%K%P
「泽嶋小姐…和父亲？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHmm... fifty points.\d%K%P
「唔～嗯，５０分」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Then who is he?\d%K%P
「诶？那这个男人是？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dNo, that wasn't wrong. It's Sawashima Junpei, the\nsupporting pillar of the Sawashima Group.\d%K%P
「不，这个男人你猜对了。泽嶋顺平。\n泽嶋集团的创始人」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah... I remember seeing his picture in a business\nmagazine before.\d%K%P
「也是啊…\n记得我曾在经济杂志上见到过」%K%P
He certainly had the aura of a business magnate, just like\nI've heard.%K%P
而且怎么说呢，这位传奇人物的外表，\n流露着一种泽澤集团创始人的威严。%K%P
But in that case, that meant I mistook the identity of the\nbaby.%K%P
也就是说，我猜错的是那个婴儿…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Huh?\d%K%P
「…咦？」%K%P
As I got tired of staring at the two, I glanced at the\nscenery behind them.%K%P
就在我凝视着相片里的这两人有些累了，\n背景映入我眼帘的瞬间。%K%P
It was strange. Or rather, it was so familiar I blanked\nout for a second.%K%P
有种违和感…说不出的违和感，\n突然间，我的脑海中天旋地转。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Wait a second. Was this picture taken...\d%K%P
「等等，先等一下…\n这张相片拍摄的地点…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYes. It was taken here, at the Terrace House Hinosaka.\d%K%P
「没错，Terrace House阳之坂」%K%P
Shabby gates with a long run-down one-floor building\nbehind them.%K%P
古旧的门槛。\n还有简陋而…别有风情的平房。%K%P
The place that meant so much to me. It was right there, in\nthat photograph.%K%P
对如今的我来说，无比重要的地方，就在其中。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAs my father's business expanded to Kantou, he built a\nhouse for himself in Hagimori and moved there when I was\nstill a child, leaving my mother behind in Nagoya. This\npicture was taken at the apartment next door.\d%K%P
「父亲去关东创业之际，把母亲和年幼的我留在了名古屋，\n一个人住在冬萩守的别院…旁边的公寓」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Eh? ...Eh?\d%K%P
「诶？诶？…诶？」%K%P
The house he had built was most likely the one Himeo used\nto live in before that whole bath construction business.%K%P
泽嶋家的『东萩守的别院』，也就是，\n现在姫绪小姐所住的地方。%K%P
Before her, Sawashima Junpei used to live there. And if I\nwasn't mistaken, it's been about sixteen or seventeen\nyears since the Sawashimas expanded to Kantou.%K%P
泽嶋顺平以前就住在那里。\n而且泽嶋房地产到关东发展，\n确实是在十几年以前。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dCan you tell who that baby is now?\d%K%P
「这下你明白了吧？\n那个婴儿是谁」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-Mi...\d%K%P
「美、美…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThe reason I left Nagoya and instead went to a university\nhere was because I wanted to meet someone, no matter what\n-- my little sister.\d%K%P
「我离开名古屋，到这里求学来…\n是因为有个无论如何也要见的人…我的『妹妹』」%K%P
